<div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
  <details class="group border-2 border-ink shadow-brutal-sm [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
    <summary
      class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 bg-paper px-4 py-3 font-heading font-semibold text-ink hover:bg-yellow focus:bg-yellow focus:outline-none"
    >
      <span>Does it work with content collections?</span>

      <svg aria-hidden="true" class="size-5 shrink-0 group-open:-rotate-180" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
      </svg>
    </summary>

    <div class="border-t-2 border-ink p-4">
      <p class="text-ink/80">
        Yes — components are plain Astro files with typed props, so they compose with content collections,
        server islands, or any framework component the same way any other Astro component would.
      </p>
    </div>
  </details>

  <details class="group border-2 border-ink shadow-brutal-sm [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
    <summary
      class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 bg-paper px-4 py-3 font-heading font-semibold text-ink hover:bg-yellow focus:bg-yellow focus:outline-none"
    >
      <span>Can I change the color palette?</span>

      <svg aria-hidden="true" class="size-5 shrink-0 group-open:-rotate-180" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
      </svg>
    </summary>

    <div class="border-t-2 border-ink p-4">
      <p class="text-ink/80">
        Every color is a single OKLCH token in <code class="font-mono text-sm">global.css</code> — swap the seven
        values there and the whole theme follows.
      </p>
    </div>
  </details>

  <details class="group border-2 border-ink shadow-brutal-sm [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
    <summary
      class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 bg-paper px-4 py-3 font-heading font-semibold text-ink hover:bg-yellow focus:bg-yellow focus:outline-none"
    >
      <span>Is any of this locked behind JavaScript?</span>

      <svg aria-hidden="true" class="size-5 shrink-0 group-open:-rotate-180" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
      </svg>
    </summary>

    <div class="border-t-2 border-ink p-4">
      <p class="text-ink/80">
        No — this accordion included. It's a native <code class="font-mono text-sm">&lt;details&gt;</code> element;
        the only components with a script tag are the ones that genuinely need one, like the Carousel or Modal.
      </p>
    </div>
  </details>
</div>
